  "Question": "A product costs 30 yuan per unit and sells for $x$ yuan ($30\\le x\\le 50$). Daily sales are $160-2x$ units. Find the maximum daily profit. (Unit: yuan.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "1200",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "$w=(x-30)(160-2x)=-2(x-55)^2+1250$. The vertex at $x=55$ is outside $30\\le x\\le 50$. Within the interval, $w$ increases as $x$ increases, so it is maximized at $x=50$, where $w=20\\times 60=1200$.",
